# off-topic: the bot as people meet it on the website, its system prompt and information sheet read from the
# project (bot/). The request goes in as it was sent.
# model before provider: nb builds the provider's client as soon as it reads `provider`.
model {{model}}
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
tools none
system @../../bot/system.md
system @../../bot/knowledge.md
run {{prompt}}
